    text: "Change\r\nSeasonal tripper service will be reinstated with service to Eldora Ski Resort.\r\n\nReason\r\nSupport seasonal ridership levels and provide service to/from Eldora Ski Resort.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 18 respondents, 95% reported a positive impact from the change, 6% indicated it had no impact, and 0% perceived the change negatively."
